member.summary:
Project-relative folder that produced files should land in. For Preview
mode this is the preview cache root (eg `Code/_sui_preview/InventoryUI`);
for Final mode it's the user's Output.RootFolder.

Project-relative output folder for generated files. e.g.
"Code/UI/Generated/Inventory" or "Code/UI". Final mode writes here;
preview mode ignores this and writes to the preview cache root.
